          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Eliashibu Omukulu wa Bakabona ni bakabona baine, baasitukiramu baazimba ogwetebwa Omulyango ogw'Entaama, baakola omukolo ogw'okugutukuza, era baagutaamu n'endhigi dhaamu. Baatukuza ekimante ekyo okutuuka ku kyetebwa Ekituuti Ekirengererwaku Ekyekikumi, n'okutuuka ku kindi ekyetebwa Ekituuti ekya Hananeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
