          "text": "Malikiya mutabane wa Rekabu eyafuganga ekiketezo ky'e Bethi Hakkeremu n'eyalongoosa ogwetebwa Omulyango ogw'Obusa. Yaaguzimba buyaaka, yaagutaamu endhigi dhaamu, era endhigi edho yaadhitaaku eminhololo n'ebisiba ebindi.",
