        {
          "text": "Shallumu mutabane wa Kolihoze, eyafuganga ekiketezo ky'e Mizipa, n'eyalongoosa ogwetebwa Omulyango ogw'Ensulo. Yaaguzimba buyaaka, yaagusereka, yaagutaamu endhigi dhaamu, era endhigi edho yaadhitaaku eminhololo n'ebisiba ebindi. Era yaazimba n'ekimante eky'oku Kidiba kya Shela okumpi n'enimiro ya kyabazinga, yaakituukiza irala aghaali amadaala agaika okuva mu kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi.",
