          "text": "Ku oyo kwairaku Ezeri mutabane wa Yeshua eyafuganga ekiketezo eky'e Mizipa, yaalongoosa ekitundu ekiringiriire ghe batereka eby'okulwanisa, okutuukira irala ku kimante ghe kigonhokera.",
