              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku abo kwairaku Azaria mutabane wa Maaseia era mwidhukulu wa Anania, yaalongoosa ekitundu ekyairaku ku kimante ekyo, ekyali kiriiraine endhu ye.",
